Description: Privileged Linux input broker
 A Linux service and C library for global keyboard and mouse hooks, input
 synthesis, blocking and physical input-state queries. The same API works
 on X11 and Wayland. Applications use libkeysharp-input.so.0; the root
 service owns evdev and uinput access.
